<title>USA: Dentsply acquires DW Industries.</title>
<headline>Dentsply acquires DW Industries.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dentsply International Inc said Thursday it had completed the acquisition of DW Industries Inc in a cash transaction valued at about $17 million.</p>
<p>The company said it expected the acquisition of the manufacturer of disposable air-water syringe tips to add about $7.0 million to its annual sales.</p>
<p>Dentsply designs, develops, manufactures and markets products for the dental market.</p>
